<title>FRANCE: Club Med suspended limit down.</title>
<headline>Club Med suspended limit down.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Club Mediterranee were suspended limit down at the opening for 15 minutes and the suspension was later extended for another 15 minutes, the SBF French stock exchanges' association said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Club Med on Tuesday evening said it expected a flat pre-tax, pre-exceptional profit and noted additional commercial costs during the summer had not generated a sufficient rise in volumes.</p>
<p>Club Med on Tuesday closed at 398 francs. Its new lower level is 323.30. The Bourse will try to requote at 0830 GMT.</p>
</text>
